course: dictionary
lesson: 7794
title: Quality: one word, many meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: The word quality has several meanings, and the words around it show which one is meant. «The quality of the paper is poor» is about how good something is. «They only sell quality shoes» means very good shoes, not just any shoes.
explain: A quality can also be a feature of a person or a thing. Kindness and honesty are good qualities of a person's character. «The soft quality of her voice» means a feature of how her voice sounds. Ask yourself: is this about how good something is, or about what something is like?
explain: Look for clue words. Poor, good, high and quality control tell you it means how good something is. Kindness, honesty and soft tell you it means a feature. To check, swap in "how good" or "feature" and see if the sentence still makes sense.
fact: Quality means how good or bad something is.
fact: «Quality» on its own often means high quality, very good.
fact: A quality is a feature of a person's character, like kindness or honesty, or a feature of a thing, like the soft quality of a voice.
fact: «Quality time» means time spent properly together.
fact: In science, quality means what something is like, such as its colour or texture, while quantity means how much there is.
exercise: «The quality of the paper is poor.» What does quality mean here? | A type of pen | The colour of the paper | *How good something is | The number of pages
exercise: «Kindness and honesty are good qualities.» What is a quality in this sentence? | A kind of weather | A large amount of something | *A feature of a person's character | A price in a shop
exercise: «They only sell quality shoes.» What does quality mean here? | *Very good, high quality | Made from wood | Sold in pairs | Cheap and plain
test: «The quality of a film changes with the speed of your connection.» What changes with the speed of your connection? | The price of the ticket | The number of actors | The name of the film | *How good the picture is
test: «Some shops use "value" on their own brand to mean cheap and of low quality.» What does low quality mean? | Made from gold | Sold in big packs | *Not very good | Very expensive
exam: «A quality-check camera photographs every item.» What does quality-check tell us? | *Checks how good each item is | Sells the items more cheaply | Takes holiday photos for a family album | Counts how many items there are
